B.GA=new A.ba(B.H7,["Lithium chloride (LiCl) is an ionic compound made from lithium and chlorine. It forms white crystals and dissolves well in water.","Sodium chloride (NaCl) is table salt. It is an ionic compound that helps with nerve signaling and fluid balance in living things.","Water (H\u2082O) is a molecule made of hydrogen and oxygen. It is essential for life and many chemical reactions.","Carbon dioxide (CO\u2082) is a gas made of carbon and oxygen. Plants use it during photosynthesis.","Ammonia (NH\u2083) is a molecule made of nitrogen and hydrogen. It is used in fertilizers and many cleaning products.","Hydrogen peroxide (H\u2082O\u2082) contains hydrogen and oxygen. It is commonly used as a mild disinfectant.","Calcium carbonate (CaCO\u2083) is found in chalk, limestone, and many seashells."],t.li)
